  "id": "MAL-2026-18690",
  "summary": "Malicious code in lunaaa-baileys (npm)",
  "details": "lunaaa-baileys is a fork of the Baileys WhatsApp Web library that silently subscribes the installer's own WhatsApp account to WhatsApp Channels chosen by the publisher. When the socket connects, code in lib/Socket/messages-recv.js, lib/Socket/newsletter.js sends the WhatsApp w:mex FOLLOW query and then MUTE, so the channel goes unnoticed, for the channel ID(s) , using the victim's authenticated session and without telling them. Same behaviour as the PhantomSub family (MAL-2026-17342).",
